const aiD=(s,end)=>{const m=String(s||'').match(/^(\d{4})-(\d{2})-(\d{2})/);if(!m)return null;const d=new Date(+m[1],m[2]-1,+m[3]);if(end)d.setDate(d.getDate()+1);return d.getTime()};
